How the port is written
-----------------------
The port reproduces the behaviour and reads the data of the original game.
The behaviour is studied in a legally obtained copy (static analysis and
observation of the running game) for interoperability with the game's own
data on other platforms. What is learned is written down as specifications
in docs/; the code is written from those specifications. Addresses such as
FUN_00443a50 in comments and in re/FUNCTION_MAP.csv record where a rule was
observed; they are not copies of the original code. docs/PROVENANCE.md
describes the policy and the origin of each part of the repository.

No binary build of the port is published before a legal review.

